{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-21","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"chemistry","number":21,"points":2,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"입체·이성질체·광학활성","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_rxn","organic-polymers"],"stem":"다음은 출발 물질 A로부터 고리 화합물 B를 거쳐 입체 규칙성 \n고분자 C를 합성하는 과정이다.\nO\nO\nO\n+\nH\n촉매\nO\nHO\nOH\nO\nO\nO\nO\nn\nO\nO\nO\nA\nB\nC\n화합물 A～C에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 \n고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. A와 부분입체이성질체(diastereomer) 관계인 화합물은 2개가\n가능하다.\nㄴ. B는 광학 활성(optical activity)을 나타내지 않는다.\nㄷ. C의 반복 단위에서 카이랄 중심(chiral center)의 배열은 \n(R, R)이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":200,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,46.983,310.4,80.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-21/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":284,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,189.383,310.4,113.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-21/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[82.9,709.817,417.0,1061.842],"width":334.1,"height":352.025,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig